\"2026-10-01\"}","420",[197,198,203],"pre",{"className":199,"code":200,"language":201,"meta":202,"style":202},"language-vue shiki shiki-themes material-theme-lighter material-theme material-theme-palenight","\u003CFunctionalCalendar v-model=\"value\" is-date-range is-modal is-typeable \u002F>\n","vue","",[180,204,205],{"__ignoreMap":202},[206,207,210,214,218,222,225,228,232,234,237,240,243],"span",{"class":208,"line":209},"line",1,[206,211,213],{"class":212},"sMK4o","\u003C",[206,215,217],{"class":216},"swJcz","FunctionalCalendar",[206,219,221],{"class":220},"spNyl"," v-model",[206,223,224],{"class":212},"=",[206,226,227],{"class":212},"\"",[206,229,231],{"class":230},"sTEyZ","value",[206,233,227],{"class":212},[206,235,236],{"class":220}," is-date-range",[206,238,239],{"class":220}," is-modal",[206,241,242],{"class":220}," is-typeable",[206,244,245],{"class":212}," \u002F>\n",[176,247,248,249,252,253,256,257,260],{},"Type ",[180,250,251],{},"5\u002F3\u002F2026"," or ",[180,254,255],{},"05\u002F03\u002F2026"," into an input, then try ",[180,258,259],{},"31\u002F02\u002F2026",".",[262,263,265],"h2",{"id":264},"what-the-input-accepts","What the input accepts",[267,268,269,273,292,300,310,313],"ul",{},[270,271,272],"li",{},"Day and month with one or two digits, and a four digit year.",[270,274,275,276,279,280,283,284,252,287,289,290,260],{},"The separator of ",[180,277,278],{},"dateFormat",", which is ",[180,281,282],{},"\u002F",", ",[180,285,286],{},"-",[180,288,260],{},". The default is ",[180,291,282],{},[270,293,294,295,297,298,260],{},"Padded and unpadded dates give the same value. ",[180,296,255],{}," is stored as ",[180,299,251],{},[270,301,302,303,283,305,283,307,309],{},"Typing any of ",[180,304,286],{},[180,306,260],{},[180,308,282],{}," or a space where a separator belongs inserts the format's separator.",[270,311,312],{},"Letters and extra digits are dropped as you type. A third digit in the day, or a fifth in the year, is not accepted.",[270,314,315],{},"A digit that overflows a full part moves into the next part when you type at the end.",[262,317,319],{"id":318},"when-the-value-commits","When the value commits",[176,321,322,323,183,325,328,329,332],{},"The calendar updates the value only when the text is a complete, real date: all parts present, a four digit year, and a day that exists in that month. ",[180,324,259],{},[180,326,327],{},"1\u002F1\u002F26"," change nothing, and ",[180,330,331],{},"29\u002F02\u002F2028"," is accepted.",[176,334,335],{},"In a range, each input commits on its own. Typing a start date does not need an end date.",[262,337,339],{"id":338},"paste","Paste",[176,341,342,343,283,345,283,347,349,350,352,353,356,357,360,361,260],{},"A pasted date has its ",[180,344,286],{},[180,346,260],{},[180,348,282],{}," and space separators replaced with the separator of ",[180,351,278],{},", so ",[180,354,355],{},"5.10.2026"," becomes ",[180,358,359],{},"5\u002F10\u002F2026",". The text is then cut to what the format can hold. Parts are not reordered, so paste them in the order of ",[180,362,278],{},[262,364,366],{"id":365},"time","Time",[176,368,369,370,373],{},"With ",[180,371,372],{},"displayTimeInput",", the time stays in the input text while you edit the date part.",[262,375,377],{"id":376},"forms","Forms",[176,379,380,381,260],{},"Enter in these inputs is not intercepted, so a surrounding form submits. See ",[382,383,384],"a",{"href":72},"keyboard",[262,386,388],{"id":387},"tags-input","Tags input",[176,390,391],{},"The multiple date picker shows its dates as tags. Type a date and press Enter. The date is added if it is valid.",[262,393,395],{"id":394},"read-the-value","Read the value",[176,397,398,399,402,403,407],{},"The calendar writes typed dates into the object you bound, in place and without an ",[180,400,401],{},"update:modelValue"," event. Start with a full model, as shown in ",[382,404,406],{"href":405},"\u002Fgetting-started\u002Fusage#the-bound-value","usage",", so the keys exist before the first click.",[409,410,411],"style",{},"html pre.shiki code .sMK4o, html code.shiki .sMK4o{--shiki-light:#39ADB5;--shiki-default:#89DDFF;--shiki-dark:#89DDFF}html pre.shiki code .swJcz, html code.shiki .swJcz{--shiki-light:#E53935;--shiki-default:#F07178;--shiki-dark:#F07178}html pre.shiki code .spNyl, html code.shiki .spNyl{--shiki-light:#9C3EDA;--shiki-default:#C792EA;--shiki-dark:#C792EA}html pre.shiki code .sTEyZ, html code.shiki .sTEyZ{--shiki-light:#90A4AE;--shiki-default:#EEFFFF;--shiki-dark:#BABED8}html .light .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-light);background: var(--shiki-light-bg);font-style: var(--shiki-light-font-style);font-weight: var(--shiki-light-font-weight);text-decoration: var(--shiki-light-text-decoration);}html.light .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-light);background: var(--shiki-light-bg);font-style: var(--shiki-light-font-style);font-weight: var(--shiki-light-font-weight);text-decoration: var(--shiki-light-text-decoration);}html .default .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-default);background: var(--shiki-default-bg);font-style: var(--shiki-default-font-style);font-weight: var(--shiki-default-font-weight);text-decoration: var(--shiki-default-text-decoration);}html .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-default);background: var(--shiki-default-bg);font-style: var(--shiki-default-font-style);font-weight: var(--shiki-default-font-weight);text-decoration: var(--shiki-default-text-decoration);}html .dark .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-dark);background: var(--shiki-dark-bg);font-style: var(--shiki-dark-font-style);font-weight: var(--shiki-dark-font-weight);text-decoration: var(--shiki-dark-text-decoration);}html.dark .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-dark);background: var(--shiki-dark-bg);font-style: var(--shiki-dark-font-style);font-weight: var(--shiki-dark-font-weight);text-decoration: var(--shiki-dark-text-decoration);}",{"title":202,"searchDepth":413,"depth":413,"links":414},2,[415,416,417,418,419,420,421],{"id":264,"depth":413,"text":265},{"id":318,"depth"